{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00083",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 2.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Hello. Right, let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 4.11,
      "end_seconds": 9.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.23,
      "end_seconds": 15.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. What seems to be the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.37,
      "end_seconds": 18.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "He's been feeling low most days, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.6,
      "end_seconds": 21.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.14,
      "end_seconds": 31.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.85,
      "end_seconds": 34.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.8,
      "end_seconds": 42.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "I'd say moderate. Oh, and trouble sleeping. That's been about the same, nearly five years. I've also had no energy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.01,
      "end_seconds": 47.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Have you been losing interest in things you used to enjoy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.03,
      "end_seconds": 60.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.26,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, four weeks. So, um, as for losing interest in things I used to enjoy, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.58,
      "end_seconds": 78.99,
      "duration_seconds": 17.41,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.4,
      "end_seconds": 81.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.35,
      "end_seconds": 83.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.7,
      "end_seconds": 87.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Not at all, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.6,
      "end_seconds": 92.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Any periods of unusually high energy, panic attacks or thoughts of harming myself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.72,
      "end_seconds": 94.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.75,
      "end_seconds": 97.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.91,
      "end_seconds": 100.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.65,
      "end_seconds": 104.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.24,
      "end_seconds": 111.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, you know, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.55,
      "end_seconds": 125.74,
      "duration_seconds": 13.19,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.57,
      "end_seconds": 130.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Okay, so good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.82,
      "end_seconds": 136.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.36,
      "end_seconds": 141.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I'm on thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 142.11,
      "end_seconds": 150.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, I think the last prescription for the thyroxine was 37.5 micrograms. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.83,
      "end_seconds": 153.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.65,
      "end_seconds": 162.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. I'm, I'm on sertraline, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.52,
      "end_seconds": 164.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.18,
      "end_seconds": 165.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.49,
      "end_seconds": 169.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.35,
      "end_seconds": 175.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "For two months. I take bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.91,
      "end_seconds": 180.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.19,
      "end_seconds": 183.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.98,
      "end_seconds": 185.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.13,
      "end_seconds": 193.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "I've had depression for five years now. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.05,
      "end_seconds": 194.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.61,
      "end_seconds": 204.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had an irregular heartbeat for nearly five years now. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.25,
      "end_seconds": 207.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Let me just write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.99,
      "end_seconds": 221.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Right, carry on. What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.89,
      "end_seconds": 225.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.28,
      "end_seconds": 227.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.83,
      "end_seconds": 231.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.38,
      "end_seconds": 237.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.83,
      "end_seconds": 238.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.45,
      "end_seconds": 257.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.18,
      "end_seconds": 261.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I had my appendix out about eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.69,
      "end_seconds": 265.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.01,
      "end_seconds": 266.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.37,
      "end_seconds": 283.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.47,
      "end_seconds": 290.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "My father had a stroke. My uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.16,
      "end_seconds": 293.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.4,
      "end_seconds": 301.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Yes, latex, it gives me a rash on my hands. Peanuts, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.22,
      "end_seconds": 305.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.34,
      "end_seconds": 310.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.54,
      "end_seconds": 312.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.71,
      "end_seconds": 323.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Alright, just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.79,
      "end_seconds": 345.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 114 over 76, SpO2 98 percent on room air. And pulse is 78 beats a minute, temperature 36.9."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.98,
      "end_seconds": 347.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.62,
      "end_seconds": 366.4,
      "duration_seconds": 17.78,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Putting together what you've described, it fits best with a depressive episode. A reaction to recent stress is also on my list. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling low most days, moderate, and no panic attacks or periods of unusually high energy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.66,
      "end_seconds": 368.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.66,
      "end_seconds": 385.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.11,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for low mood. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Let's get blood tests, for low mood. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.36,
      "end_seconds": 388.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.14,
      "end_seconds": 414.17,
      "duration_seconds": 24.03,
      "text": "It usually takes a few weeks for the tablet to start helping, so give it time and stay in touch. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.57,
      "end_seconds": 416.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.68,
      "end_seconds": 435.66,
      "duration_seconds": 14.98,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you have thoughts of harming yourself. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back in four weeks. Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.89,
      "end_seconds": 440.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.71,
      "end_seconds": 446.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 447.16,
      "end_seconds": 449.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.5,
      "end_seconds": 451.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}